  "scope": "A single kind cluster runs isolated Zot v2.1.23 registries for one exact repo and authenticated case-owned OCI Distribution API actors. An open policy allows read/create/update/delete; a guarded policy allows read/create only; a third registry adds a deliberately explicit adminPolicy override for one synthetic actor. Fixed inert OCI manifests exercise initial tag creation, same-tag overwrite, digest readback, manifest deletion/recreation, and the documented adminPolicy boundary. The case checks native audit and filtered HTTP access events for selected operations. It does not establish deployed identity governance, durable audit forwarding, sync/retention behavior, or protection against storage administrators and registry-internal processes.",
